      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Apothecary. Skincare-label calm: a centred column, light type, one quiet figure per screen, the settings as an ingredient list.\n\nLayout: One 760-px centred column, very large vertical gaps, hairline spec tables; nothing boxed, nothing loud.\nThe memorable thing: The ten settings printed like an ingredient list, with their values as concentrations.\nType: Hanken Grotesk 200–300 for headlines and big figures, 400 for text, 600 for values.\nLight: bg #ECEDE8, surf #F5F6F2, ink #22251F, muted #5B5F56, acc #566849, line #C6C9BF\nDark: bg #1B1D19, surf #22251F, ink #E4E6DF, muted #9A9F93, acc #A9BC94, line #3A3E35\nMagnet rail on the left edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
    }
